  <p class="credits-eyebrow">13 Times 3</p>
  <h1 id="credits-title">Credits</h1>
  <p class="credits-intro">The gallery is a place for our memories. Thank you to the artists whose work helps bring it to life.</p>
  <section class="credit-card" aria-labelledby="music-credit-title">
    <p class="credits-eyebrow">Gallery music</p>
    <h2 id="music-credit-title">“Resolutions”</h2>
    <p>Music by <a href="https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/resolutions/">Scott Buckley</a>.</p>
    <p>Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International</a>.</p>
    <p>The original MP3 was re-encoded at 128 kbps for web delivery. The music itself was not edited.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="credit-card" aria-labelledby="figure-credit-title">
    <p class="credits-eyebrow">Gallery figures</p>
    <h2 id="figure-credit-title">Clothed figure base</h2>
    <p>Oleg’s and Jane’s sculpted figures use modified bodies and rigs from <a href="https://www.innerscene.com/tools/library/3d-parts/relaxed-walk-sam-3d-person-animated-732f1206">Innerscene’s “Relaxed walk — Sam”</a> and <a href="https://www.innerscene.com/tools/library/3d-parts/relaxed-walk-maya-3d-person-animated-2c6669a2">“Relaxed walk — Maya”</a>, released under CC0.</p>
    <p>The original head and animation were replaced with the gallery’s illustrated likeness and still poses.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="credit-card" aria-labelledby="fish-credit-title">
    <p class="credits-eyebrow">Aquarium sculpture</p>
    <h2 id="fish-credit-title">Painted fish</h2>
    <p>The detailed fish in the aquarium are adapted from the <a href="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets/tree/main/Models/BarramundiFish">Khronos glTF Sample Assets BarramundiFish</a> model, released under CC0. Its texture was repainted for the gallery and the model was compressed for mobile viewing.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="credit-card" aria-labelledby="tree-credit-title">
    <p class="credits-eyebrow">Street scenery</p>
    <h2 id="tree-credit-title">Outdoor shade trees</h2>
    <p>The job-search street, friendship garden, blue-car street, apple orchard, and Play Garden use an adapted <a href="https://poly.pizza/m/qZtx0AHhcy">tree by Quaternius</a>, released under CC0. Its scale, color, orientation, and mobile materials were changed for this gallery.</p>
  </section>
